OL,3,ASimon Jack: Is Poundland's US owner to 
OL,4,Ablame for its collapse?                
OL,6,FThe blame game for the demise of       
OL,7,FPoundland is in full swing.            
OL,9,FThe number one target is US-based      
OL,10,FGordon Brothers who bought the discount
OL,11,Fchain for #1 and have taken nearly #20m
OL,12,Fout of the business already.           
OL,14,FGordon Brothers stand to get paid back 
OL,15,Fa further #22.5m, as their share of an 
OL,16,Fexisting #30m loan is set to be one of 
OL,17,Fthe first debts that the administrators
OL,18,Fwill have to pay out of the proceeds of
OL,19,Fany sale of the business in whole or in
OL,20,Fpart.                                  
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
